  "bodyHtml": "\n\n<p class=\"RegularParagraphs\"><span style=\"color:#030303;letter-spacing:-.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><b><span style=\"color:#030303;letter-spacing:-.1pt\">[§342D-85.5]&nbsp; </span></b><b>Water<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.0pt\"> </span>pollution<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.9pt\"> </span>control<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.85pt\"> </span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">fund; </span>transfers.</b>&nbsp;\nThe<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.75pt\"> </span>governor, or a state official\nacting pursuant to authorization from the governor,<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.05pt\"> </span>may<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>transfer an\namount<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\"> </span>up<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.5pt\"> </span>to or equal to<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\"> </span>thirty-three<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">per </span><span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">cent, calculated on the basis<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span>a<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.5pt\"> </span>fiscal<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.8pt\"> </span>year's<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.45pt\"> </span>drinking water treatment revolving loan\nfund<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span></span>capitalization<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.95pt\"> </span>grant<span style=\"letter-spacing:.05pt\"> </span>amount,\nfrom the water pollution control revolving fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n.15pt\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.85pt\"> </span>drinking<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">\n</span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:.3pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.1pt\">treatment </span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:.15pt\"> </span>loan<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.8pt\"> </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.35pt\"> </span>established\nunder<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.85pt\"> </span>section<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.7pt\"> </span>340E-35,<span style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\"> </span>or<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.0pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">an </span>equivalent<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\"> </span>dollar<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\"> </span>amount<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>from<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.9pt\"> </span>drinking<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.65pt\">\n</span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.1pt\">treatment </span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:.25pt\"> </span>loan<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.75pt\"> </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.1pt\"> </span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>pollution<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.35pt\"> </span>control <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">revolving </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:.05pt\"> </span>established<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n.4pt\"> </span>under<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.6pt\"> </span>section<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\"> </span>342D-83.&nbsp; The<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.95pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">following </span>conditions\nshall<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.1pt\">apply:</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"oneParagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"position:relative;top:-1.0pt\">(1)<span style=\"letter-spacing:3.6pt\"> </span>When the State initially decides to<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.1pt\"> </span>transfer<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.0pt\">\n</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">funds </span></span><span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">pursuant<span style=\"letter-spacing:.5pt\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.3pt\"> </span>this<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">section:</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"ASubparagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">(A)&nbsp; The<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.45pt\"> </span>attorney<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\">\n</span>general,<span style=\"letter-spacing:.75pt\"> </span>or an individual\ndesignated by the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.65pt\"> </span>attorney<span style=\"letter-spacing:.75pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">general,\nshall have signed or concurred in a certification for the drinking water\ntreatment revolving loan fund and water pollution control revolving fund that\nstate law permits the State to transfer funds; </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.25pt\">and</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"ASubparagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">(B)<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.9pt\"> </span>The<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.5pt\"> </span>operating<span style=\"letter-spacing:.7pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">agreements\n</span>or<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>other<span style=\"letter-spacing:.05pt\"> </span>parts<span style=\"letter-spacing:.5pt\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing:.3pt\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\"> </span>capitalization<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.8pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">grant </span>agreements<span style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\"> </span>for the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.0pt\">\n</span>drinking water<span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">treatment </span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n.85pt\"> </span>loan<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.7pt\"> </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>and<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.75pt\"> </span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\"> </span>pollution <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">control\n</span></span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\"> </span>fund shall be\namended<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.55pt\"> </span>detail<span style=\"letter-spacing:.75pt\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.65pt\"> </span>method the State shall<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\"> </span>use<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.05pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">to </span>transfer<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n.65pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">funds;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"oneParagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#050505\">(2)&nbsp; The State shall not\nuse the transfer provision to acquire state match for either fund or use\ntransferred funds to secure or repay state match bonds;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"oneParagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (3)&nbsp; The<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.45pt\"> </span>State<span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\"> </span>may<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\"> </span>reserve<span style=\"letter-spacing:.05pt\"> </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span>amounts<span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\"> </span>for<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\"> </span>transfer<span style=\"letter-spacing:.25pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">in </span>future<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.75pt\"> </span>years<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\"> </span>pursuant<span style=\"letter-spacing:.7pt\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.75pt\"> </span>requirements<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>under <span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">federal\n</span>law;<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\n-.25pt\">and</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"oneParagraph\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#050505\">(4)<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n.95pt\">&nbsp; </span>Funds<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.35pt\"> </span>may<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.2pt\"> </span>be<span style=\"letter-spacing:.95pt\">\ntransferred </span>on<span style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\"> </span>a<span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\"> </span>net<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.1pt\"> </span>basis<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.45pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">between\n</span><span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">the<span style=\"letter-spacing:\n1.1pt\"> </span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.4pt\"> </span>pollution<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.1pt\"> </span>control<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.05pt\">\n</span>revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.65pt\"> </span>fund<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.35pt\"> </span>and<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.5pt\"> </span>drinking<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.6pt\"> </span>water<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.45pt\"> </span></span></span>treatment<span style=\"color:#050505;position:relative;top:-.5pt;letter-spacing:3.0pt\"> </span><span style=\"color:#050505;position:relative;top:-.5pt\">revolving<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.15pt\"> </span>loan<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.6pt\"> </span>fund;<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.1pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">provided\n</span></span><span style=\"color:#050505\">that<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.4pt\">\n</span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing:.7pt\"> </span>thirty-three<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.2pt\"> </span>per<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.4pt\"> </span>cent<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.0pt\"> </span>transfer<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.9pt\">\n</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">allowance </span><span style=\"position:relative;top:-.5pt\">associated<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.3pt\">\n</span>with<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.2pt\"> </span>drinking water treatment\nrevolving loan<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.9pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.2pt\">fund </span></span>capitalization<span style=\"letter-spacing:.85pt\"> </span>grants<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.6pt\"> </span>received<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.55pt\"> </span>is<span style=\"letter-spacing:1.6pt\"> </span>not<span style=\"letter-spacing:2.85pt\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">exceeded.</span>\n[L 2024, c 218, §3]</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"RegularParagraphs\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"RegularParagraphs\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n"
